     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs</b></p><a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs\"> </a><a name=\"hcng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>https://fhir-ig.digitalhealth.gov.ng/CodeSystem/ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">marital-status-1<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-marital-status-1\"> </a></td><td>Single</td><td>Source form code 1: Single.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">marital-status-2<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-marital-status-2\"> </a></td><td>Married</td><td>Source form code 2: Married.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">marital-status-3<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-marital-status-3\"> </a></td><td>Divorced</td><td>Source form code 3: Divorced.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">marital-status-4<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-marital-status-4\"> </a></td><td>Separated</td><td>Source form code 4: Separated.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">marital-status-5<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-marital-status-5\"> </a></td><td>Cohabiting</td><td>Source form code 5: Cohabiting.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">marital-status-6<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-marital-status-6\"> </a></td><td>Widower</td><td>Source form code 6: Widower.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">educational-status-1<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-educational-status-1\"> </a></td><td>No education</td><td>Source form code 1: No education.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">educational-status-2<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-educational-status-2\"> </a></td><td>Primary Education</td><td>Source form code 2: Primary Education.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">educational-status-3<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-educational-status-3\"> </a></td><td>Secondary Education</td><td>Source form code 3: Secondary Education.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">educational-status-4<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-educational-status-4\"> </a></td><td>Tertiary Education</td><td>Source form code 4: Tertiary Education.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">educational-status-5<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-educational-status-5\"> </a></td><td>Others</td><td>Source form code 5: Others (specify).</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">care-entry-point-1<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-care-entry-point-1\"> </a></td><td>OPD</td><td>Source form code 1: Outpatient department.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">care-entry-point-2<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-care-entry-point-2\"> </a></td><td>Inpatients</td><td>Source form code 2: Inpatients.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">care-entry-point-3<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-care-entry-point-3\"> </a></td><td>HTS</td><td>Source form code 3: HIV testing services.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">care-entry-point-4<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-care-entry-point-4\"> </a></td><td>TB DOTS</td><td>Source form code 4: TB DOTS.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">care-entry-point-5<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-care-entry-point-5\"> </a></td><td>STI Clinic</td><td>Source form code 5: STI Clinic.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">care-entry-point-6<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-care-entry-point-6\"> </a></td><td>ANC/PMTCT</td><td>Source form code 6: ANC/PMTCT.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">care-entry-point-7<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-care-entry-point-7\"> </a></td><td>Transfer-in</td><td>Source form code 7: Transfer-in.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">care-entry-point-8<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-care-entry-point-8\"> </a></td><td>Community</td><td>Source form code 8: Community.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">care-entry-point-9<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-care-entry-point-9\"> </a></td><td>Others</td><td>Source form code 9: Others (specify).</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">prior-art-1<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-prior-art-1\"> </a></td><td>Earlier ARV but not a transfer in</td><td>Source form code 1.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">prior-art-2<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-prior-art-2\"> </a></td><td>Transfer in without records</td><td>Source form code 2.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">prior-art-3<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-prior-art-3\"> </a></td><td>PrEP</td><td>Source form code 3: Pre-exposure prophylaxis.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">prior-art-4<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-prior-art-4\"> </a></td><td>PEP</td><td>Source form code 4: Post-exposure prophylaxis.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">kp-typology-1<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-kp-typology-1\"> </a></td><td>MSM</td><td>Source form code 1: Men who have sex with men.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">kp-typology-2<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-kp-typology-2\"> </a></td><td>FSW</td><td>Source form code 2: Female sex workers.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">kp-typology-3<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-kp-typology-3\"> </a></td><td>PWID</td><td>Source form code 3: People who inject drugs.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">kp-typology-4<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-kp-typology-4\"> </a></td><td>TG</td><td>Source form code 4: Transgender persons.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">kp-typology-5<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-kp-typology-5\"> </a></td><td>Persons in custodial centers</td><td>Source form code 5.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">cd4-reference-less-than-200<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-cd4-reference-less-than-200\"> </a></td><td>&lt;200 cells/mm3</td><td>CD4 result below 200 cells/mm3.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">cd4-reference-greater-than-or-equal-200<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-cd4-reference-greater-than-or-equal-200\"> </a></td><td>≥200 cells/mm3</td><td>CD4 result greater than or equal to 200 cells/mm3.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">tpt-1<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-tpt-1\"> </a></td><td>Isoniazid (6H)</td><td>Source form code 1: Isoniazid for six months.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">tpt-2<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-tpt-2\"> </a></td><td>Isoniazid and Rifapentine (3HP)</td><td>Source form code 2.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">tpt-3<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-tpt-3\"> </a></td><td>Isoniazid and Rifampicin (3HR)</td><td>Source form code 3.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">tpt-4<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-tpt-4\"> </a></td><td>CTX/INH/B6 FDC (QTIP)</td><td>Source form code 4: Cotrimoxazole/Isoniazid/Pyridoxine fixed-dose combination.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">drug-resistance-result-1<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-drug-resistance-result-1\"> </a></td><td>Wild type</td><td>Source form code 1.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">drug-resistance-result-2<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-drug-resistance-result-2\"> </a></td><td>Resistant detected</td><td>Source form code 2.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">drug-resistance-result-3<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-drug-resistance-result-3\"> </a></td><td>No resistance detected</td><td>Source form code 3.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">drug-resistance-result-4<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-drug-resistance-result-4\"> </a></td><td>Partial or mixed resistance</td><td>Source form code 4.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">drug-resistance-result-5<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-drug-resistance-result-5\"> </a></td><td>Indeterminate or unsuccessful test</td><td>Source form code 5.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">regimen-change-reason-1<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-regimen-change-reason-1\"> </a></td><td>Toxicity/side effects</td><td>Source form code 1.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">regimen-change-reason-2<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-regimen-change-reason-2\"> </a></td><td>Pregnancy</td><td>Source form code 2.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">regimen-change-reason-3<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-regimen-change-reason-3\"> </a></td><td>Risk of pregnancy</td><td>Source form code 3.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">regimen-change-reason-4<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-regimen-change-reason-4\"> </a></td><td>Due to new TB</td><td>Source form code 4.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">regimen-change-reason-5<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-regimen-change-reason-5\"> </a></td><td>New drug available</td><td>Source form code 5.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">regimen-change-reason-6<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-regimen-change-reason-6\"> </a></td><td>Drug out of stock</td><td>Source form code 6.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">regimen-change-reason-7<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-regimen-change-reason-7\"> </a></td><td>Clinical treatment failure</td><td>Source form code 7.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">regimen-change-reason-8<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-regimen-change-reason-8\"> </a></td><td>Immunologic failure</td><td>Source form code 8.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">regimen-change-reason-9<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-regimen-change-reason-9\"> </a></td><td>Virologic failure</td><td>Source form code 9.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">regimen-change-reason-10<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-regimen-change-reason-10\"> </a></td><td>Other reason</td><td>Source form code 10: Other reason (specify).</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">art-stop-reason-1<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-art-stop-reason-1\"> </a></td><td>Toxicity/side effects</td><td>Source form code 1.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">art-stop-reason-2<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-art-stop-reason-2\"> </a></td><td>Pregnancy</td><td>Source form code 2.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">art-stop-reason-3<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-art-stop-reason-3\"> </a></td><td>Treatment failure</td><td>Source form code 3.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">art-stop-reason-4<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-art-stop-reason-4\"> </a></td><td>Poor adherence</td><td>Source form code 4.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">art-stop-reason-5<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-art-stop-reason-5\"> </a></td><td>Illness or hospitalization</td><td>Source form code 5.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">art-stop-reason-6<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-art-stop-reason-6\"> </a></td><td>Drugs out of stock</td><td>Source form code 6.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">art-stop-reason-7<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-art-stop-reason-7\"> </a></td><td>Patient lacks finances</td><td>Source form code 7.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">art-stop-reason-8<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-art-stop-reason-8\"> </a></td><td>Other patient decision</td><td>Source form code 8.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">art-stop-reason-9<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-art-stop-reason-9\"> </a></td><td>Planned treatment interruption</td><td>Source form code 9.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">art-stop-reason-10<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-art-stop-reason-10\"> </a></td><td>Other</td><td>Source form code 10: Other (specify).</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">cause-of-death-1<a name=\"ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-cause-of-death-1\"> </a></td><td>HIV related</td><td>Source form code 1.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">cause-of